rpi-splash-screen-support (1.0.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Fix cmdline.txt corruption when the file contains newlines or CRLF
    line endings; collapse newlines to spaces instead of deleting them,
    which previously glued kernel parameters into one invalid token
  * Back up cmdline.txt to cmdline.txt.bak before modifying
  * Quote the cmdline.txt filename throughout

